: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">福特、樂金集團去年在國際碳揭露計畫（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CDP</span>）的分級中獲得「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>」評級。路透</span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<hr initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; border: 0px; background-image: -webkit-linear-gradient(left, transparent, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), transparent); color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\" />\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">國際碳揭露計畫（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">CDP</span>）在評比全球<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8,400</span>家企業<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年所揭露資料的對抗氣候變遷行動後，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>日公布評等清單，共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">179</span>家企業被列為獲得「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>」頂級評等的「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖名單」，包括美國福特汽車（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Ford</span>）與微軟（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Microsoft</span>）、日本<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Sony</span>南韓樂金集團（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">LG</span>）、丹麥樂高集團（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">LEGO</span>）等，被認為最能因應氣候變遷的影響。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這份<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2019</span>年報告中，台灣共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">129</span>家企業被評比，台灣大哥大、日月光投資控股、光寶科技、矽品等四家公司獲得「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>」評等，躋身在氣候數據的透明度、及對抗氣候變遷行動都是頂尖全球企業之林。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">世界先進、元大金融控股、南亞塑膠工業、南亞科技、台塑石化、第一金控、南亞電路板、台達電子、國泰金控、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">UMC<span>&nbsp;</span></span>聯華電子、福懋興業等台灣企業，則獲得「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A-</span>」評等，仍是產業領先水準。台積電的評等為「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">B</span>」，代表處於「管理水準」。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">這項報告為<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">8,400</span>家公司做分級，評等從「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>」到「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">D-</span>」，僅<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2%</span>被列入排行頂端的「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>」評級。「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖名單」除了最新加入的福特、樂金，還有蘋果、<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Google</span>母公司字母（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Alphabet</span>）、零售業者沃爾瑪（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Walmart</span>）以及花旗集團（<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">Citigroup</span>）、瑞典<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">H&amp;M</span>等。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">CDP</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">為非營利組織，鼓勵企業、城市、州來揭露並管理自身對環境的影響；企業股東則利用這項數據評估一家企業是否在這方面有進步。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">以各地來看，名列「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖企業」者以歐洲最多，共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">85</span>家，亞洲有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">51</span>家，北美有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">36</span>家。日本企業首度主宰「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖名單」，共<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">38</span>家，多於去年的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20</span>家。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">CDP</span><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">表示，「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖企業」被認為氣候數據的透明度、與揭露的完整程度為產業佼佼者，並且在了解氣候風險後，展現強烈的風險治理與管理行動，包括設定以科學為基礎的目標、轉向再生能源、投資低碳產品創新等。<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">STOXX</span>的數據也顯示，這些「<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">A</span>咖企業」的年度股價表現也比同業高於<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5.5%</span>。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline